-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
PLACE YOUR CORPORATE CA CERTIFICATE HERE
This is an example file. Replace with your actual corporate CA certificate.

To obtain your certificate:
1. Contact your IT department
2. Export from Windows Certificate Manager (certmgr.msc)
3. Look for "Trusted Root Certification Authorities"
4. Export as Base-64 encoded X.509 (.CER)

Save the actual certificate as: corporate-ca.crt
-----END CERTIFICATE-----
